# ValueSet.description
#: ValueSet.description
msgid "Proposal: LOINC codes of the clinical test 'Hemoglobin concentration in blood' (standard tier, specimen Blood), computed by ECL over the LOINC Ontology 2026-03-21. Parts: LOINC enumeration (19), LOINC Ontology observables without LOINC code (0), and the ECL as an intensional include. ECL: << 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 246093002 |Component (attribute)| = 38082009 |Hemoglobin (substance)|, << 704327008 |Direct site (attribute)| = << 119297000 |Blood specimen (specimen)|, << 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = << 118539007 |Mass concentration (property) (qualifier value)|, << 370132008 |Scale type (attribute)| = << 30766002 |Quantitative value (qualifier value)|"
msgstr ""

